.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-mora-branch 1  "branch " 
.SH NAME
git\-mora\-branch \- Create a uniquely named agent branch and print its name
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit mora branch\fR <\fB\-\-agent\-id\fR> [\fB\-\-target\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISTART_POINT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a uniquely named agent branch and print its name
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\-id\fR \fI<id>\fR
Agent/session identifier
.TP
\fB\-\-target\fR \fI<branch>\fR
Intended publication target; defaults to the current branch\*(Aqs literal name
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fISTART_POINT\fR]
Starting commit or branch; defaults to HEAD
